"An error occurred during parsing of element_string: AI code %(ai_code)s is "
"missing for scheme %(scheme_name)s"
msgstr ""
"ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃນລະຫວ່າງການວິເຄາະ element_string: ລະຫັດ AI %(ai_code)s ຂາດຫາຍໄປສຳລັບຮູບແ"
"ບບ %(scheme_name)s"

