"An error occurred: value of company_prefix_length (%"
"(company_prefix_length)s) must be between 6 and 12 inclusive."
msgstr ""
"ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ: ຄ່າຂອງ company_prefix_length (%(company_prefix_length)s) ຕ້ອງຢູ່ລະຫວ່າ"
"ງ 6 ຫາ 12."

